                                                "example_id": "203ce968-355f-45b4-a407-64e8f1fec4b4",
                                                "sense_id": "6ef9a574-3c25-3bb0-acf3-9c3f2807ce3b",
                                                "text": "A few years earlier, I’d restored my ’65 Mustang convertible to cherry condition—fire engine red, with matching tuck-and-roll—and I wasn’t surprised that it drew attention."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d193416c-fef9-4413-8e7d-6f628b32fd51",
